      "text": "On Friday, we proudly authenticated the keels for the first three cutters in the Coast Guard’s new \"Chief's Class\" of Waterways Commerce Cutters: the future CGC Allen Thiele, CGC Fred Permenter and CGC Samuel Wilson.\n\nThese cutters are vital for maintaining the Marine Transportation System, which supports over $5.4 trillion in economic activity.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/3jdL3sbbju\n\n#USCG #WaterwaysCommerceCutter #MaritimeSecurity #Acquisition\n@DHSgov @USCGHeartland \n\nArtistic rendering courtesy of Birdon",
